flowchart TD
    U[User selects a workflow in the left navigation]
    U --> S[Search: selected collections or model only]
    U --> R[Deep research: explicit collections, index and budget]
    U --> D[Document analysis: private expiring upload]
    R --> J[PostgreSQL job, evidence checkpoints and streamed report]
    J <-->|delivery and recovery| Q[Redis notifications and fenced worker leases]
    J --> M[Scoped read-only MCP and shared qualified models]
    M --> J
    D --> P[Private PostgreSQL, Redis and artifact storage]
    P --> X[Qualified native text extraction]
    X --> W[Independent private vector writer]
    X -. optional async image work .-> C[Separate capped-retry caption worker]
    C --> W
    W --> E[Private Elasticsearch projection and owned questions]
    E --> M
    D --> A[Explicit Add to collection with destination write permission]
    A --> I[Copy original into ordinary durable intake]
    I --> V[External writer verifies Elasticsearch and enrolled Milvus]
    D --> T[Expiry or Delete now immediately fences access]
    T --> F[Cleanup private indexes, files, queues and content rows]
    V --> K[Accepted permanent copy survives private expiry]
